        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boisterous Battle! Seven Hearts!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asgard’s defenses have fallen! They need your help!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your team of heroes to defend against the Undeads, once and for all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*Upon your first login after purchase, you will receive 250 Diamonds, 1,000,000 GOLD, and 300 AP for free.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong># Take Your PIck!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are over 250 heroes to choose from!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own team of heroes from 7 different classes: Warrior, Rogue, Archer, Defender, Wizard, Golem, and Warlord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong># Need Back Up!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support the team with the right tank, each empowered with special abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear the old Sanctuary towers of Asgard to unlock the Ancient Protectors and add their mighty powers to your deck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong># Gear Up, Team! We Have a World to Save!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your deck by finding &amp; upgrading the right weapons and gears for your heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can strategize and build multiple decks for special types of enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your tank wisely! Each tank brings a unique set of skills to the battle field!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong># Who’s in Charge Over Here?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against other players and their decks in online PVP arenas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortify your defenses and towers strategically against other players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Siege and destroy their towers &amp; defenses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make allies and team up with your friends to fight off the raid bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong># Ready Your Tank!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 different gameplay modes from Single Play, PVP Arenas, Sanctuary, Guild Raids and many more! Find your favorite mode!</p>",
